  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHp/286",
  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>&#160;<br><span style=\"color: #616161;\">#출판사 관계자에게 톡을 보낼 수 있는 기회가 생겨</span><br><span style=\"color: #616161;\">한달전에 #출판사의 열에너지에 대한 내용에 대한 이의 신청을 다시 보내드렸습니다.</span><br>&#160;<br><br>&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #616161;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">아래 내용은 한달전 이의신청한 내용이며</span></span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #616161;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">이 내용을 그대로 다시 보내드렸습니다.</span></span></b><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br><span style=\"color: #616161;\">0.</span><br><span style=\"color: #616161;\">안녕하세요</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">, </span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">선덕중학교 과학교사 이승윤입니다</span><br><span style=\"color: #616161;\"># 출판사 </span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">2022</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">개정교육과정 중학교 </span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">1</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">학년 과학교과서</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">&#160;</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">내용에 대해 이의신청을 하고자 합니다</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">.</span><br><br><span style=\"color: #616161;\">1.</span><br><span style=\"color: #616161;\">2022</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">개정교육과정 </span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">과학 </span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">1</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">학년 교과서 </span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">136</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">쪽 왼쪽 여백 설명으로</span><br><span style=\"color: #616161;\">열에너지의 정의를 기술하고 있는 내용에 이의를 신청합니다</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">.</span><br><span style=\"color: #616161;\">&quot;</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">열에너지 </span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">: </span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">온도가 다른 두 물체 사이에서 이동하는 에너지로 물질의 온도나 상태를 변화시킨다</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">.&quot;</span><br><span style=\"color: #616161;\">라고 기술되어 있습니다</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">.</span><br><br><span style=\"color: #616161;\">이 내용은</span><br><span style=\"color: #616161;\">&quot;</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">열에너지</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">&quot;</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">의 내용이 아닌 </span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">&quot;</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">열</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">&quot;</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">에 대한 내용입니다</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">.</span><br><br><span style=\"color: #616161;\">2.</span><br><span style=\"color: #616161;\">&quot;</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">열에너지</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">&quot; VS &quot;</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">열</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">&quot;</span><br><span style=\"color: #616161;\">열에너지와 열은 구분되어지는 과학 용어입니다</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">.</span><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><br><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">근거자료 </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">1 - </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">위키백과 </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#39;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">열</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#39;</span></span><br><a href=\"https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EC%97%B4\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\"><span style=\"color: #616161;\">https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EC%97%B4</span></a><br><br><span style=\"color: #616161;\">세번째 문단</span><br><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">&#39;열에너지&#39;라는 용어는 종종 열이라는 용어와 혼동하여 사용된다. 하지만 둘은 다르다</span><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">.</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">열은 에너지의 전달 방식 중의 하나이고</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">, </span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">열에너지는 어떤 계</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">(system)</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">가 가진 내부 에너지를 말한다</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">. </span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">어떤 계에 열이 흐르면</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">(=</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">온도가 높은 곳에서 낮은 곳으로 에너지가 이동하면</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">), </span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">그 계의 열에너지</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">(</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">내부 에너지</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">)</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">는 증가하고</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">, </span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">열 흐름으로 인해 에너지가 이동하면 그 계의 열에너지는 감소한다</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">. </span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">뜨거운 물체는 많은 양의 열에너지를 소유하고 있다고 말할 수 있지만</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">, </span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">많은 양의 열을 소유하고 있다고 말할 수는 없다</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">. </span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">즉 물체는 </span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">&#39;</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">에너지</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">&#39;</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">를 가질 수는 있어도</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">, &#39;</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">열</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">&#39;</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">을 가질 수는 없는 것이다</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">. </span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">이러한 점 때문에 물리학에서는 열에너지라는 용어보다는 </span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">&quot;</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">내부에너지</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">&quot;</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">라는 용어가 자주 사용되고</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">, </span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">선호된다</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">.</span><br><br><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">근거자료 </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">2 - </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">할리데이 대학 물리학 책</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">(</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">개정</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">4</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">판</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">) 560</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">쪽</span></span><br><span style=\"color: #616161;\">&quot;</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">열은</span><br><span style=\"color: #616161;\">계와 주위 사이의 온도차에 의하여 이동되는 에너지이다</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">&quot;</span><br><br><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">근거자료 </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">3 - </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">할리데이 대학 물리학 책</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">(</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">개정</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">10</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">판</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">) 603~4</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">쪽</span></span><br><br><span style=\"color: #616161;\">603</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">쪽</span><br><span style=\"color: #616161;\">&quot;</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">열에너지</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">&quot;</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">는 물체 안의 미시적 구성물체의 막운동</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">(</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">랜덤운동</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">)</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">과 관련이 있다</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">.</span><br><span style=\"color: #616161;\">&quot;</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">열</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">&quot;Q</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">는 물체와 주위 사이의 온도차로 인하여</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">(</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">물체의 열에너지 혹은 열에너지로부터</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">)</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">전달되는 에너지의 양이다</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">.</span><br><br><span style=\"color: #616161;\">604</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">쪽</span><br><span style=\"color: #616161;\">&quot;</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">열</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">&quot; Q</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">는 계와 주위 사이의 온도 차이 때문에 이들 사이에서 전달되는 에너지이다</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">.</span><br><span style=\"color: #616161;\">&quot;</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">열에너지</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">&quot;</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">는 원자나 분자 같은 미시입자의 막운동과 관련된 운동에니지와 퍼텐셜에너지로 이루어진 내부에너지이다</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">.</span><br><span style=\"color: #616161;\">이렇게 전달되는 에너지를 </span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">&quot;</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">열</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">&quot;</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">이라 하며 </span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">Q</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">로 표기한다</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">.</span><br><br><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">근거자료 </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">4 - </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">대학 화학의 기초 제</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">15</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">판<br></span></span><br>36쪽 <br>&quot;<span style=\"color: #616161;\">열에너지</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">&quot;</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">는 물질의 작은 입자들의 운동과 관련된 에너지의 형태이다</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">. </span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">존재하는 열에너지의 양에 따라</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">, </span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">주어진 계가 뜨겁다 또는 차갑다라고 말한다</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">. </span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">온도는 열에너지의 세기에 대한 측정으로</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">, </span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">계의 크기에는 관계없이 계가 얼마나 뜨거운지를 나타낸다</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">.</span><br><span style=\"color: #616161;\">&quot;</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">열</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">&quot;</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">이란 용어는 온도 차이로 인해 에너지의 흐름을 나타낸다</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">. </span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">열은 항상 높은 온도 영역에서 낮은 온도 영역으로 이동한다</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">.</span><br><br><br><span style=\"color: #616161;\">위 </span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">4</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">개의 근거자료를 바탕으로</span><br><span style=\"color: #616161;\">&quot;</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">열에너지</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">&quot; </span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">용어와</span><br><span style=\"color: #616161;\">&quot;</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">열</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">&quot;</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">이라는 용어가 구분</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">, </span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">구별되어짐을 알 수 있으며</span><br><span style=\"color: #616161;\">중학교 과학 </span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">1</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">학년 교과서 </span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">3</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">단원에서 </span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">&#39;</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">열</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">&#39;</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">을 배우는데</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">,</span><br><span style=\"color: #616161;\">4</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">단원에서 </span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">&#39;</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">열에너지</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">&#39; </span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">용어의 정의를 </span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">&#39;</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">열</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">&#39;</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">의 내용이 포함되어 있음을 이의신청합니다</span><span style=\"color: #616161;\">.</span><br><br><br><span style=\"color: #616161;\">위 내용을</span><br><span style=\"color: #616161;\">교과서 검정기관인 한국과학창의재단에 이의신청을 하였더니</span><br><span style=\"color: #616161;\">각 출판사에서 검토 수정을 해야 함을 답변을 받아</span><br><br><span style=\"color: #616161;\">이렇게 내용 수정 이의신청 합니다</span><br>&#160;<br><br>근거자료2</p><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2c0e3f39ceffd2f6b77cbf041de35637b9de3c89\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"1193\" style=\"width:50.00%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2c0e3f39ceffd2f6b77cbf041de35637b9de3c89\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/212989e851c2ab2bbf6ca4e34e86338ba111ad71\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"1193\" style=\"width:50.00%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/212989e851c2ab2bbf6ca4e34e86338ba111ad71\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>근거자료3</p><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e25a5adc4114332a5348c5697bd6df2dff1b6a28\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"804\" style=\"width:25.97%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e25a5adc4114332a5348c5697bd6df2dff1b6a28\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/94e8350c74b7f4c2896106ec62e8aae65d663c50\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"282\" style=\"width:74.03%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/94e8350c74b7f4c2896106ec62e8aae65d663c50\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/72e82d83baff2b3dcab506d1daeb39917e68f856\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"282\" style=\"width:50.00%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/72e82d83baff2b3dcab506d1daeb39917e68f856\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ae3b91edcd047fba2a9f844d0af2cd39aeaa696c\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"282\" style=\"width:50.00%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ae3b91edcd047fba2a9f844d0af2cd39aeaa696c\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>근거자료4</p><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a170d88c8d72f25a181e103c5b17ce100ddebf53\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"835\" style=\"width:25.25%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a170d88c8d72f25a181e103c5b17ce100ddebf53\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4e14e861776709206d92e63c228d4b8b09dc231c\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"282\" style=\"width:74.75%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4e14e861776709206d92e63c228d4b8b09dc231c\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size23\">&#160;</span></b><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size23\">아래의 내용은 </span></b><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size23\">대표저자 분의 답변 내용입니다.</span></b><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size23\">&#160;</span></b><br>&#160;<br>22개정교육과정&#160;문서에서&#160;다음과&#160;같이&#160;기술하고&#160;있습니다. <br>[9과04-04]&#160;물질의&#160;상태&#160;변화와&#160;열에너지&#160;출입&#160;관계를&#160;이해하고,&#160;이를&#160;실생활에&#160;적용하여&#160;과학의&#160;유용성을&#160;인식할&#160;수&#160;있다. <br>첫&#160;문장에서&#160;사용된&#160;&quot;열에너지&quot;는&#160;출입하는&#160;주체를&#160;의미하고&#160;이는&#160;이의신청자가&#160;주장한&#160;&quot;열&quot;을&#160;의미하는&#160;것입니다.&#160;<br>즉,&#160;따라서&#160;교과서의&#160;기술&#160;내용을&#160;교육과정의&#160;요구&#160;사항을&#160;정확하게&#160;표현한&#160;것입니다.&#160;<br>&quot;열에너지&quot;라는&#160;표현이&#160;내부에너지를&#160;표현하기도&#160;하지만&#160;열을&#160;표현하기도&#160;합니다.&#160;<br>근거&#160;자료는&#160;&quot;열에너지&quot;&#160;표현이&#160;내부에너지를&#160;표현하는데&#160;주로&#160;사용되는&#160;것이라는데는&#160;동의합니다만,&#160;<br>&quot;열에너지&quot;&#160;표현을&#160;열의&#160;의미로도&#160;사용하지&#160;않아야&#160;한다는&#160;근거&#160;자료는&#160;아닙니다.&#160;<br>교육과정에서도&#160;열의&#160;의미로&#160;표현하고&#160;있습니다.&#160;<br>현재&#160;교과서는&#160;법령에&#160;의해서&#160;작성된&#160;것이고&#160;이&#160;표현은&#160;과거&#160;교육과정에서도&#160;사용되고&#160;있습니다.&#160;<br>이&#160;표현이&#160;문제가&#160;있다면&#160;차기&#160;교육과정&#160;개정할&#160;때&#160;공론화&#160;과정에서&#160;수정되어야&#160;할&#160;것으로&#160;판단합니다.&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>--------------------------------<br>&#160;<br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">아래 내용은 저의 추가 질의 입니다</span></b><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>답변 전달해주셔서 감사합니다.<br><br>1. <br>[&quot;열에너지&quot;&#160;표현을 <br>&quot;열&quot;의&#160;의미로도&#160;사용하지&#160;않아야&#160;한다는 <br>근거자료는&#160;아닙니다] <br>이게&#160;무슨&#160;말인지요? <br><br>&quot;열에너지&quot;와&#160;&quot;열&quot;의&#160;정의를&#160;구분하여&#160;사용된&#160;여러&#160;교재들을&#160;근거로&#160; <br>제가&#160;제시하였어요. <br><br>열에너지의&#160;정의&#160;안에&#160;열의&#160;정의가&#160;들어가&#160;있으면&#160;안된다고&#160; <br>딱&#160;명시되어&#160;있는&#160;책을&#160; <br>찾아오라는&#160;말로밖에&#160;안들려요.ㅠ <br><br>계의&#160;&quot;에너지의&#160;출입&quot;은&#160; <br>일,&#160;열,&#160;입자&#160;뿐이에요 <br>이것들이(에너지의&#160;출입)&#160;가지는&#160;에너지는&#160;종류가&#160;없어요 <br><br>에너지의&#160;출입에&#160;의해 <br>어떤&#160;계가&#160;가지는&#160;에너지의&#160;형태의&#160;종류가&#160;있어요. <br>그&#160;중&#160;하나가&#160;&#39;열에너지&#39;에요. <br><br>열에너지&#160;정의&#160;안에&#160; <br>열의&#160;정의&#160;내용이&#160;들어갈&#160;수&#160;없어요. <br><br>2. <br>교육과정에&#160;명시된&#160;성취기준&#160;용어&#160;사용이&#160;잘못되었어요 <br>&#39;발열&#39;&#160;&#39;흡열&#39;은&#160;맞지만 <br>&#39;열에너지&#160;출입&#39;&#160;&#39;열에너지&#160;흡수&#39;&#160;&#39;열에너지&#160;방출&#39;은&#160;잘못된&#160;사용이에요. <br><br>비유하면 <br>운동에너지&#160;방출,&#160;위치에너지&#160;출입 <br>이렇게&#160;사용하는&#160;용어사용입니다 <br>에너지는&#160;전환(일,열)을&#160;통해&#160; <br>에너지가&#160;저장되는&#160;형태(종류)가&#160;달라지는&#160;것이죠. <br>&#160; <br>3. <br>열에너지는&#160;계에&#160;저장된&#160;에너지의&#160;종류&#160;증&#160;하나, <br>(열에너지를&#160;내부에너지와&#160;같이&#160;쓰느냐&#160;구분하느냐고&#160;혼란&#160;스러운&#160;것이지, <br>열과&#160;열에너지를&#160;혼용,&#160;혼동해서&#160;쓰면&#160;안됩니다) <br>열의&#160;정의를&#160;보면&#160;열은&#160;&#39;이동&#39;의&#160;개념입니다&#160; <br>하나의&#160;계에서&#160;다른&#160;계로&#160; <br>&#39;일&#39;과&#160;같은&#160;에너지의&#160;전달,&#160;전환의&#160;의미입니다<br>&#160;<br>&#160;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><br>--------------------------------------------<br>더 이상 답변을 안하실 듯 보입니다(개인적 생각)<br>&#160;<br>#출판사는<br>열에너지에 대한 정의 내용을 수정하지 않을 것 같습니다.ㅜㅜ<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>---------------------------------------------<br>제가 신청한<br>지금까지 2022개정교육과정 중1 과학교과서<b> &#39;열에너지&#39; 정의에 대한 이의신청한 건은 3건(3개 출판사)</b>입니다<br>&#160;<br><a href=\"https://blog.naver.com/sayment/223727586002?trackingCode=blog_bloghome_searchlist\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://blog.naver.com/sayment/223727586002?trackingCode=blog_bloghome_searchlist</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"2022개정교육과정 중학교 1학년 과학 7종 교과서의 &quot;열에너지에 대한 정의&quot; 분석\" data-og-description=\"열에너지에 대한 정확한 정의로 기술되지 않고 있는 중학교 과학교과서에 대해 글을 지속적으로 작성하고 ...\" data-og-host=\"blog.naver.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://blog.naver.com/sayment/223727586002?trackingCode=blog_bloghome_searchlist\" data-og-url=\"https://blog.naver.com/sayment/223727586002\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bDpNJS/hyYFC6DLeS/PKbBB3Eo0CKe6PH28wYnx1/img.jpg?width=743&amp;height=743&amp;face=231_169_363_301\"><a href=\"https://blog.naver.com/sayment/223727586002?trackingCode=blog_bloghome_searchlist\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://blog.naver.com/sayment/223727586002?trackingCode=blog_bloghome_searchlist\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bDpNJS/hyYFC6DLeS/PKbBB3Eo0CKe6PH28wYnx1/img.jpg?width=743&amp;height=743&amp;face=231_169_363_301\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">2022개정교육과정 중학교 1학년 과학 7종 교과서의 &quot;열에너지에 대한 정의&quot; 분석</p><p class=\"og-desc\">열에너지에 대한 정확한 정의로 기술되지 않고 있는 중학교 과학교과서에 대해 글을 지속적으로 작성하고 ...</p><p class=\"og-host\">blog.naver.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>&#160;<br>아래 링크는<br>나머지<br>다른 출판사 이의신청에 대한 답변입니다<br><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/cen/2012\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/cen/2012</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Daum 카페\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"cafe.daum.net\" data-og-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/cen/2012\" data-og-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/_c21_/bbs_read?grpid=1TaBA&amp;fldid=cen&amp;datanum=2012\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/cen/2012\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/cen/2012\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Daum 카페</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">cafe.daum.net</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/cen/2009\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/cen/2009</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Daum 카페\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"cafe.daum.net\" data-og-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/cen/2009\" data-og-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/_c21_/bbs_read?grpid=1TaBA&amp;fldid=cen&amp;datanum=2009\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://cafe.d